// was removed. All 4 codes (mn_cn, xng, omx, mnw) already had a static
// `disambiguator: { en, ja, ko, zh }` field on their meta block, so
// the overlay's `if (!meta.disambiguator)` setter was a no-op for
// every entry — the richer 18-UI-lang text was dead code at runtime.
// Static-grep coverage of meta.disambiguator now reflects actual
// runtime behavior without reading initializer loops.
//
// To upgrade any of these 4 disambiguators from 4-lang to 18-lang
// translations, edit the static meta block directly. Do not
// reintroduce a runtime overlay. The 18-lang text is preserved in
// git history (commit landing this Task 192 batch); recover with
// `git log -p -- wordmap_meta.js` and search for "DISAMBIGUATORS".

